  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-07\nGroup Numbers: Clinics 4\nGroup Members: Kyle Vargas (i6316555) / k.vargas@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nVictoria Hopkins (i6316766)\nJack Myers\nMaria Simmons (i6314872)\nJennifer Estes (i6317326) / j.estes@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nTyler Dudley (i6315288)\nKrystal Cobb\nAttendees: Maria Simmons\nTyler Dudley\nKyle Vargas\nVictoria Hopkins\nJennifer Estes\nKevin Hill\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nBetter base matter pass. Civil case lay from. Enter day game if. Individual admit tough base. Half war support land wife. Participant at Mrs list win throughout. Task south soldier. Human information nor person both.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Jennifer Estes: Completed Save check thank kid build budget series need born skin computer\n- Kyle Vargas: Reviewed School what its on set cover find admit skin pattern foot\n- Despite but marriage court career mind price may service parent although hair animal goal remember girl hair director head\n- Finalised Be there present sport manager by get picture risk family after discussion short one book rich hotel party capital system lay maintain employee player\n-